@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1FAF9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #147D80
skinparam ArrowColor #48677A
title Price check | implementation flow, not live acceptance proof
actor "Scheduler /\nadmin" as Trigger
participant "Bounded check\nworker" as Worker
database "MongoDB\nclaims + history" as DB
participant "Provider cache\n+ budget" as Cache
participant CheapShark as CS
participant "Episode\nevaluator" as Eval
participant "Delivery\nworker" as Dispatch
participant "Resend / FCM" as External
Trigger -> Worker : scheduled or admin-only manual run
Worker -> DB : claim due product (fenced lease)
Worker -> Cache : resolve shared game / Steam offer
Cache -> CS : fixed endpoint; bounded request (if needed)
CS --> Cache : offer / error / 429
alt successful exact Steam offer
 Cache --> Worker : normalized USD cents
 Worker -> DB : fenced write: product + observed history
 Worker -> Eval : evaluate owned trackers
 Eval -> DB : episode state + unique channel outbox
 note over Eval,DB : <= target opens once; successful > target rearms.\nTarget change can start new evaluation.
else error, missing offer or throttle
 Cache --> Worker : failure / Retry-After
 Worker -> DB : retain last success; record failure
 note over Worker,DB : No zero fallback, history, alert or rearm.
end
Dispatch -> Dispatch : independent interval poll (runBatch)
Dispatch -> DB : claim eligible channel delivery
Dispatch -> External : email or push independently
External --> Dispatch : accepted / failure / unknown
Dispatch -> DB : record channel outcome
note over Dispatch,External : Permission and active owned session gate push.\nUnknown send is reconciled, not blindly retried.\nNo end-to-end exactly-once guarantee.
caption History collection requires source-policy approval; diagram is not proof of live collection.
@enduml
